          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "(1) 5.0 Lは50 dLなので、ヘモグロビン量は次の通りです。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "15\\times50=7.5\\times10^2\\ \\mathrm{g}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "(2) 1 g当たりの最大結合量を掛けます。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "6.0\\times10^{-5}\\times7.5\\times10^2=4.5\\times10^{-2}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "(3) 心臓から出たとき100%、全身を回った後80%なので、20%が消費されます。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "4.5\\times10^{-2}\\times0.2=9.0\\times10^{-3}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "(4) 6.0 Lの20%が酸素で、22.4 Lが1モルです。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\frac{6.0\\times0.2}{22.4}=5.4\\times10^{-2}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "(5) 消費量を肺へ入る酸素量で割り、100を掛けます。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "100\\times\\frac{9.0\\times10^{-3}}{5.4\\times10^{-2}}=17\\%",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "note",
            "label": "この大問の進め方",
            "text": "10題は独立です。最初に因数分解、対称性、約数、二項確率など短い型を拾い、重い積分・三角方程式は後回しにします。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 2,
            "text": "第2問 解答一覧",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "answer_key",
            "items": [
              {
                "label": "(1)",
                "value": "\\(2,\\pm{}i,\\pm{}2i\\)"
              },
              {
                "label": "(2)",
                "value": "5"
              },
              {
                "label": "(3)",
                "value": "4"
              },
              {
                "label": "(4)",
                "value": "41桁"
              },
              {
                "label": "(5)",
                "value": "6組"
              },
              {
                "label": "(6)",
                "value": "2"
              },
              {
                "label": "(7)",
                "value": "\\(\\frac14\\)"
              },
              {
                "label": "(8)",
                "value": "\\(\\frac{343}{8192}\\)"
              },
              {
                "label": "(9)",
                "value": "\\(x=y=\\frac\\pi4\\)"
              },
              {
                "label": "(10)",
                "value": "\\(2\\sqrt3\\)"
              }
            ],
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "sangyo-medical-2025-general-a-b-mathematics-answers-p002",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 2,
            "text": "第2問 (1)〜(5)",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "(1) x-2をまとめ、残りをx²の2次式として因数分解します。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "(x-2)(x^2+1)(x^2+4)=0",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "(2) PはABを直径とする円上を動き、XはPでの接線上を動きます。最小距離は中心Cから接点までの半径です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "C=\\frac{a+b}{2}=(2,1),\\qquad AC=5",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "crop",
            "asset_id": "a2-tangent-circle",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "(3) y=xとy=(x+sin x)³は奇関数です。3√|x|だけが偶関数として残ります。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "2\\int_0^1 3\\sqrt{x}\\,dx=4",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "(4) 25^119が167桁なので10^166≤25^119<10^167です。指数を29/119倍して25^29を挟みます。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "10^{40}<25^{29}<10^{41}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "(5) 積が18になる整数の因数組を列挙します。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "(2x-9)(y+2)=18",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "sangyo-medical-2025-general-a-b-mathematics-answers-p003",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 2,
            "text": "第2問 (6)・(7)",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "(6) 合同な面をもつ四面体を図示し、底面の高さOH=2、高さCS=2を得ます。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "V=\\frac13\\left(\\frac12\\cdot3\\cdot2\\right)\\cdot2=2",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "crop",
            "asset_id": "a2-tetrahedron",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "(7) 回転体の体積をlog pの2次関数として整理します。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\frac1\\pi V(p)=\\int_1^2(\\log p+\\log x)^2\\,dx",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "=(\\log p+2\\log2-1)^2+\\text{定数}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "平方部分が0のとき最小です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\log p=1-2\\log2=\\log\\frac e4",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "sangyo-medical-2025-general-a-b-mathematics-answers-p004",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 2,
            "text": "第2問 (8)・(9)",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "(8) 最初の4回で7がちょうど1回、5回目に7が出る並びです。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "{}_4C_1\\frac18\\left(\\frac78\\right)^3\\frac18=\\frac{343}{8192}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "(9) 第2式を和積公式で変形し、定義域から(x+y)/2=π/4を得ます。第1式も和積公式と三倍角公式で変形します。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\frac{x+y}{2}=\\frac\\pi4",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "u=\\sin\\frac{x-y}{2}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "4u(u-1)(u+1)=0",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "0<y≤x<πより(x-y)/2=0を選びます。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "x=y=\\frac\\pi4",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "sangyo-medical-2025-general-a-b-mathematics-answers-p005",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 2,
            "text": "第2問 (10)",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "中心を結ぶ線と共通接線でできる直角三角形からPQ=4√3です。半径比2:6を使う相似でPRを求めます。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "2:6=PR:(PR+4\\sqrt3)",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "PR=2\\sqrt3",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "crop",
            "asset_id": "a2-tangent-circles",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "note",
            "label": "この大問の進め方",
            "text": "円を平方完成して中心と半径を読み取ります。中心のt表示、半径平方、tの恒等式、円周角の順に前問をつなぎます。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 2,
            "text": "第3問 (1)",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\left(x-(t-1)\\right)^2+\\left(y+\\frac t2\\right)^2=r^2",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "r^2=\\frac54t^2-4t+4",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "中心は \\((x,y)=(t-1,-t/2)\\) です。\\(t\\) を消去します。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "y=-\\frac12x-\\frac12",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "sangyo-medical-2025-general-a-b-mathematics-answers-p006",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 2,
            "text": "第3問 (2)〜(4)",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "(2) 半径平方をtの平方で完成します。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "r^2=\\frac54\\left(t-\\frac85\\right)^2+\\frac45",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "t=\\frac85",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "C=\\left(\\frac35,-\\frac45\\right)",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "(3) 円の式をtの恒等式と見て、tの係数と定数項を0にします。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "-2x-y+2=0",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "x^2+y^2+2x-3=0",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "A\\left(\\frac15,-\\frac85\\right)",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "B(1,0)",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "(4) \\(t=1\\) では \\(AP\\) が直径なので \\(\\angle ABP=90^\\circ\\) です。\\(AB\\) と \\(AP\\) から \\(PB\\) を求めます。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "AB=\\frac{4\\sqrt5}{5},\\qquad AP=\\sqrt5",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "PB=\\frac{3\\sqrt5}{5}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "[PAB]=\\frac12\\cdot AB\\cdot PB=\\frac65",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "crop",
            "asset_id": "a3-circle-triangle",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "sangyo-medical-2025-general-a-b-mathematics-answers-p007",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 2,
            "text": "第3問の確認",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "中心は平方完成、最小半径はtの2次関数、固定通過点は恒等式、面積は直径に対する円周角を使う、という役割分担です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "note",
            "label": "この大問の進め方",
            "text": "5個の例を列挙して規則を確認し、最後に1個食べる場合と2個食べる場合へ分けます。一般項は特性方程式の2根、極限は絶対値の大きい根で割ります。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 2,
            "text": "第4問 (1)・(2)",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "(1) 1と2の和が5になる順序付き列を数えると8通りです。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "a_5=8",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "(2) 最後に1個食べる前はn-1個、最後に2個食べる前はn-2個を食べ終えています。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "a_n=a_{n-1}+a_{n-2}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "sangyo-medical-2025-general-a-b-mathematics-answers-p008",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 2,
            "text": "第4問 (3)",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "特性方程式の2根をα=(1-√5)/2、β=(1+√5)/2とします。漸化式を2本の等比型へ変形します。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "a_{n+1}-\\alpha a_n=\\beta^{n+1}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "a_{n+1}-\\beta a_n=\\alpha^{n+1}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "2式の差から一般項を得ます。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "a_n=\\frac1{\\sqrt5}\\left(\\beta^{n+1}-\\alpha^{n+1}\\right)",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "A=\\sqrt5",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "B=\\frac{1+\\sqrt5}{2},\\qquad C=\\frac{1-\\sqrt5}{2}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "sangyo-medical-2025-general-a-b-mathematics-answers-p009",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 2,
            "text": "第4問 (4)",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "\\(1<B\\)、\\(-1<C<0\\) なので、分母分子を大きい方の \\(B^{n+1}\\) で割ります。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\frac{a_{n+1}}{a_n}=\\frac{B-C(C/B)^{n+1}}{1-(C/B)^{n+1}}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "|C/B|<1より、その累乗は0へ収束します。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\frac{a_{n+1}}{a_n}=B=\\frac{1+\\sqrt5}{2}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
